B.aPb=s(["Four recordings, increasingly difficult: a conversation, a monologue, an academic discussion, then an academic lecture.","Read each set of questions before its recording starts \u2014 you only hear it once.","The answer is almost always a paraphrase of what you hear, not the exact wording."],t.s)
